OL,3,A'It's a dream come true' ` South
OL,4,AAfrican DJ celebrates featuring in GTA
OL,5,A6
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth African DJ Lag says it is a
OL,8,F"dream come true" to have his music
OL,9,Ffeatured on Grand Theft Auto 6 (GTA 6),
OL,10,Fthe hugely popular video game released
OL,11,Fon Thursday.
OL,13,FDJ lag, one of South Africa's
OL,14,Fbest-known electronic music producers,
OL,15,Fis among several African stars to
OL,16,Ffeature, alongside Nigerian singers
OL,17,FBurna Boy and Asake.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
