OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'It's a dream come true' ` South
OL,4,AAfrican DJ celebrates featuring in GTA
OL,5,A6
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I can't explain the feeling. I started
OL,8,Fplaying the game last night and it's
OL,9,Famazing," DJ Lag told the BBC's Newsday
OL,10,Fprogramme, adding that he had been
OL,11,Fplaying GTA since he was about 10 years
OL,12,Fold and could hardly believe he was now
OL,13,Fpart of the latest edition.
OL,15,FMany players have already had a chance
OL,16,Fto play the game following its
OL,17,Fworldwide launch.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
